{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8fd895a3-a117-8555-badd-0c173bf14e84",
  "created_at": "2026-03-06T12:25:44-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Mike Flynn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:22:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:22:14-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, good afternoon. I think I'm calling the right place. I want to report a noise problem, maybe a, sort of a noise complaint."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:22:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. We can take that down. Can you tell me a little about what the noise is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:22:31-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a heating and air unit, I think, an HVAC thing, on the roof or maybe the side of the restaurant next door to me. It's sort of a loud drone, a grinding almost. And it runs all day and I think half the night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:22:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. And how long has that been going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:22:53-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since Monday. I think it was Monday morning when it started. So that's, what, five days now. Maybe it was Sunday night, but I'm pretty sure Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:23:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday, okay. I'm writing that down. And where are you located? Where is the restaurant?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:23:10-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm at 406 Ocean Avenue. The restaurant is right next door, sort of on the Ocean Drive side. I rent, I'm a tenant, so I can't exactly go move the thing myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:23:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, understood. Four oh six Ocean Avenue. Have you spoken with the restaurant at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:23:29-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think I stopped in Wednesday and talked to somebody, maybe a manager, I'm not sure. He said he'd look into it. Nothing's changed. It's still going, I can hear it right now on the phone, probably. I'm sort of tired of hearing it, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:23:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, that sounds wearing. Let me get a few more details so I have the report right. Is it constant, or does it cycle on and off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:23:57-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly constant. It cycles a little, I think, but it never really shuts off. And with the rain coming down today it's maybe even louder, or it just seems that way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:24:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. [pause] And is it mainly at night that it bothers you, or all hours?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:24:15-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All hours, but nights are worst. I think I got maybe four hours of sleep Wednesday. Sunday I go to the flea market, and I bargain pretty hard there, I think I'm good at it, but I'm not going to bargain with a restaurant fan. I just want somebody to look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:24:35-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. I'll take the report and pass it along so it gets to the right office to follow up. May I have a callback number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:24:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's 401-555-0169. That's the landline, so I'm usually home. I think if I'm out they can leave a message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:24:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one six nine. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:25:00-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it, yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:25:02-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. So I have a loud HVAC unit at the restaurant next to four oh six Ocean Avenue, running constantly since Monday, worst at night. Anything I missed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:25:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I think that's it. When do you think somebody will actually come out? Maybe next week? I'd sort of like to know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:25:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't give you a day, I don't know how their schedule looks. But the report goes in today, and someone should call you back at that number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:25:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Well, I hope so. It's been five days already. Thanks for taking it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:25:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Flynn. Take care, and stay dry out there."
    }
  ],
